<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Dec CPI rises 0.3 pct mo/mo, +5.4 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak Dec CPI rises 0.3 pct mo/mo, +5.4 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Slovakia rose 0.3 percent, month-on-month, in December, putting prices 5.4 percent higher over the same period in 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK CONSUMER INFLATION   Dec 96    Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		0.3	 0.4	 0.3</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		5.4	 5.4	 7.2</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
